                        "username": "khangng-ampere"
                    },
                    "message": "Hi Ed, current CI failure is apparently due to all the non-printable ASCII strings in the examples:\n\n```\n            \"fruText\": \"\\u0015\\b2)u\\u0005>4oT8Vo\\u0015' \\u0004#4\",\n```\n\nShould the examples be fixed?"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
